05
Link Tasks to Pull Requests
Track PRs directly from TaskCLI.

Run:

bash
taskcli add "Review PR" --pr 17
TaskCLI will connect the task to PR #17

06
Verify Integration
Most Common Check
Confirm that TaskCLI is correctly linked to GitHub.

Run:

bash
taskcli sync
Check that tasks appear in both TaskCLI and GitHub

Resolve any errors shown in the CLI output

Potential Issues & Common Mistakes
Incorrect token scopes → Ensure your PAT includes repo and workflow.

Expired tokens → Regenerate if authentication fails.

