A: Yes. Use taskcli link < task-id> --pr < pr-number> to associate a task with a pull request.

Q: What happens if I close a GitHub issue?  
A: The linked task in TaskCLI will automatically update to “Closed”.

Q: Can multiple repositories be linked?  
